e": "Security & Sharing",\n      "description": "Face ID/PIN login, parental locks, QR/invite links for contributions, and group saving features.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#FF6F61 (coral)",\n    "secondary": "#20CFCF (teal)",\n    "accent": "#A259F7 (purple), #FFD600 (yellow)"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI uses a clean, card-based layout with large, rounded elements and soft shadows. Each screen features colorful, cartoon-style piggy avatars and playful animations. The home dashboard displays multiple piggy banks/jars with progress bars and a prominent total savings area. Navigation is simple, with large icons and clear labels. The design is intuitive for kids, with whimsical mascots, bright visuals, and kid-friendly fonts."\n}'}",
